---

<section class="hiw-link-section">
  <div class="content">
    <h2>Curious how the magic works?</h2>
    <p>Three simple chapters: build your shelf, share what you love, find your people.</p>
    <a href="/how-it-works" class="link-btn">
      Read the full story
      <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
        <path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
      </svg>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hiw-link-section {
    padding: var(--s-10) var(--s-6);
    background: var(--canvas);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .content {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 1.8rem);
    margin: 0 0 var(--s-3);
  }

  p {
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    margin: 0 0 var(--s-5);
  }

  .link-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--s-2);
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 590;
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: var(--s-3) 0;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--hairline-strong);
    transition: color var(--dur-1) var(--ease-soft), border-color var(--dur-2) var(--ease-out);
  }

  .link-btn:hover {
    color: var(--accent-hover);
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }

  .link-btn svg {
    transition: transform var(--dur-2) var(--ease-spring);
  }

  .link-btn:hover svg {
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }
</style>
